# VoodBuilder — core conventions

- Namespace: `Voodflow\Voodbuilder\` · Views: `voodbuilder::` · Config: `config('voodbuilder.*')`
- Filament plugin: `VoodbuilderPlugin` · SP: `VoodbuilderServiceProvider`
- Public extension facade: `Voodbuilder` (register only — do not fork)
- Stack: Filament **5**, Livewire **4** — use Filament 5 component namespaces
- Soft companions via modules + entitlements; core must boot without them
- Docs hub: `docs/README.md` · companions: `docs/developer/companion-integration.md` · manuals: `docs/manual/`
